nk I had aspired to, and how it would now be impossible for me to achieve.","wo":"Ma xalaat itam rang yi ma bëggoon am, ma xamni dootul mënati nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa khalaate itam rang yi ma beugone ame, ma khamni dootoul meunatie neuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2954,"row":{"en":"Smaller items are packed with additional air packing, a brown shipping box, and cross-strapped with fragile tape.","wo":"Ëmbeef yu ndaw yi deñukoy ëmbee ab ndollitu ngalaw, ab ëmb ngir yobbu bu maron buñu takke ab buum bu yomba dagg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nEmbeuf you ndaw yi degnoukoy embé ab ndollitou ngalaw, ab emb nguir yobou bou maron bouniou také ab boum bou yomba dag.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2955,"row":{"en":"And then, when you're ready, start to move on.","wo":"Soo noppee ngay fexe jël weneen yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo nopé ngay fékhé dieul wénéne yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2956,"row":{"en":"The artist had captured the essence of the subject so perfectly that it was almost as if they were still alive.","wo":"Ni leen yatt-kat bi yattee yéeme na, wane na bu baax limu bëggoon a wane, ba dangay foog ni luy dundu lañu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNi léne yatt kat bi yaté yémé na wané na bou bakh limou beugone a wané ba dangay foog ni louy doundou lagnou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2957,"row":{"en":"Wiseau then becomes jealous as Greg seems to move away from his toxic influence.","wo":"Wiseau defa daadi fiir bi Greg meleeni kuy genn ci xiir gumu nekkewon ci toxic bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWiseau dafa dadi fiir bi Greg melni kouy guenn thi hiir goumou nékewone thi toxic bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2958,"row":{"en":"It is a time of new beginnings, as the world wakes up from its winter slumber and begins to grow and change.","wo":"Jamonoy ndoorte lu bees la, ñépp yewwoo ci sedd b