ne diaroul ngour gui diko aar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2965,"row":{"en":"* A rapidly growing population. Egypt's population is expected to grow from 100 million today to 140 million by 2050.","wo":"* Askan wuy gaawa yokk lool. Ñoo ngi seentu askanu Egypt yu bari, joge ci 100 milioŋ tay, yegg ba 140 milioŋ fileek atum 2050.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAskane wuy gawa yokk lool. Gno ngui seuntou askanou egypt you bari, djogué thi 100 million tay, yeugg ba 140 million filek atoum 2050.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2966,"row":{"en":"I've been through a lot.","wo":"Dama jaar fu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama diar fou bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2967,"row":{"en":"Work is worship is a principle that states that all work, no matter how menial or insignificant it may seem, is sacred.","wo":"Liggéey jaamu Yàlla la, manaam liggéey ak lu ñàkk solo lépp diina daf ko rafetlu bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiguéy diamou yalla la maname liguéy ak lou gnakk solo lepp dina dafko rafetlou bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2968,"row":{"en":"Our guests discuss the balancing act of letting kids explore without getting charged with neglect or abuse.","wo":"Sunuy way wuyusi yi waxtaan nañu ci yemale bi wara am ngir bayyi xale yi ñu banneexu te kenn dulen tuumal caggante yorin ju bonn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnouy way woyousi yi wakhtane nagnou thi yémalé bi wara ame nguir bayi khalé yi niou baneukhou té kene doulén toumal thaganté yorine djou bone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2969,"row":{"en":"These trackers detect motion while you’re lying down to figure out when you’re awake, lightly asleep, or in deep sleep.","wo":"Soo tëddee, toppukaay yi ñooy xam ndax yaa ngi xoole, yaa ngi nelaw wala dajjantu, nelaw yu woyof wala yu xóot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo teudé topoukay yi gnoy kham ndakh ya ngui kholé yangui nelaw wala dadjiantou nelaw you wayof wala you khoté\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2970,"row":{"en":"As a result, it saw a significant increase in sales from international customers * A large corporation that manufactures medical devices translated its product manuals into multiple languages.","wo":"Ci noonu la amee yeneen kiliyaani bitim réew yu bari yuy njënd * Entreprise bu mag buy defar ay aparey medikaal, dafa tekki làkku notisu aparey bi ci làkk yu bari te wuute.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi nonou la amé yénéne kiliaani bitim réw you bari youy ndieunde entreprise bou mague bouy defar ay aparey medikaal dafa tekki lakhou notisou aparey bi thi lak you bari té wouté\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2971,"row":{"en":"There were flowers of every color and shape, vegetables of all sizes, and trees that reached for the sky.","wo":"Amoon na xeet ak melokaanu flër boo bëgg, ay lujum yu tollu nu nekk, ak garab yu njool ba laal asamaan.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmona khéte ak melokaanou flër bo beug, ay lujum you tollou nou nek, ak garab you ndiol ba lal asamaan.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2972,"row":{"en":"The term is frequently used interchangeably with the term climate change, though the latter refers to both human- and naturally produced warming and the effects it has on our planet.","wo":"Tur la wuñu faral di wecce ak coppite klimaa bi te mën nañu ànd waaye coppite klimaa dafay wax ci tàngoor wi nit waral ak tàngooru naturel ak li ñuy def ci planet bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTour la wugnu faral di wetché ak coppité klimaa bi té meun nagnou and wayé coppité klimaa dafay wakh thi tangoor wi nitt waral ak tangoorou naturel ak li gnouy def thi planet bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2973,"row":{"en":"This thing in my life where I kind of have to live a lie and pretend that everything is ok.","wo":"Nii may doxalee ci sama dund