991,"row":{"en":"I mean, it’s no Citizen Kane, but it’s a solid movie.","wo":"Lima bëgga mooy, bokkul ak Citizen Kane, waaye filmu bu neex la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima beuga moy bokoul ak citizen kane wayé film bou nekh la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2992,"row":{"en":"There are many other relaxation techniques available, so find one that works for you and make it a part of your daily routine.","wo":"Barina pexey féexal yaram yu jàppandi, kon wutal benn bu baax ci yaw nga boole ko ci mbir yi ngay def bis bu nekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarina pexéy fékhale yarame you diapandi kone woutal bene bou bakh si yaw nga boolé ko si mbire yi ngay def bise bou neke.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2993,"row":{"en":"But Rajiv was hungry, and he didn't listen to the tree.","wo":"Waaye Rajiv daa xiifoon, dégluwul garab gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé Rajiv da khifone deglouwoul garab gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2994,"row":{"en":"The 25-year-old woman, who has not been identified, was hiking in the mountains when she became separated from her group.","wo":"Jenn ndaw su jigéen la ju am 25 at, xama guñu turam, dafa doon yéeg tundu ak ay ñimu àndaloon jekk saa tàqaloo ak ñoom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJenn ndaw bou djiguéne la dji ame 25 ans, khamagnou tourame, dafa done yégue toundou ak ay gnimou andalone diekk saa takhaloo ak gnom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2995,"row":{"en":"The turtle thanked Lily for saving her life, and Lily promised to always be kind to animals.","wo":"Mbonaat bi daal di gërëm Lily ci limu ko xettali, Lily niko baayima yi samay xarit lañuy musa doon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbonaat bi daldi geureum Lily thi limouko khettali, Lily niko bayima yi samay kharit laniouy meussa done.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2996,"row":{"en":"Or they'll just think you're an idiot, said Ben.","wo":"Ben niko, wala ñu jàpp ni danga dof.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn niko wala gnou diap ni da nga dof rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2997,"row":{"en":"She didn't resign, so her manager decided to bury her in an infinite quantity of miscellaneous tasks.","wo":"Dellowutoon ndombo tankam bi njàatigam bi fas yéene ko suul ci ay ligéey yu bëri","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDellowoutone ndombo tankam bi niatigam bi fass yéné ko soul thi ay liguey you beuri\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2998,"row":{"en":"Why are the Asian-owned businesses shown in movies like this almost always restaurants?","wo":"Lan moo waral liggéeyukaayu yi doomi asie yi moom ñu koy wane ci film yu mel ni daanaka yépp ay resto lañu?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLane mo waral ligueyoukayou yi domi asie yi mom gnou koy wané ci film you melni danaka yeup ay resto lagnou?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2999,"row":{"en":"Rum is a versatile spirit that can be used in a variety of cocktails.","wo":"Rhum alkol la boo mëna jëfandikoo ci njaxas yu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRhum alcool la bo meuna dieufandiko si niahass you bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}